{"t":"bark","id":"low_hp","shout":"HELP!","lines":["The deep takes its due.","My beard is singed and so am I.","Tell my clan I tried.","I see a light. Is it mithril?","Hold the line. Somebody."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"hurt","shout":"OOF!","lines":["My good beard!","Orc steel, cheap and sharp.","That one I felt in my axe arm.","Stone does not flinch. I do."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"reloading","shout":"WAIT!","lines":["The rune still cools.","Patience, the forge is slow.","The runes need a breath."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"passive","shout":"HM?","lines":["That rune works by itself.","Carved and forgotten. It works.","No need to call it."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"no_target","shout":"WHERE?","lines":["Nothing to cleave.","Save it for the horde.","The dark is empty. For now."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"empty","shout":"NAUGHT!","lines":["No rune there.","An empty socket.","Dig up something first."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"level","shout":"STRONGER!","lines":["The halls remember me.","Another rune learned.","Ding! Somebody sound the horn.","My axe grows heavier. Good."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"streak","shout":"HA HA!","lines":["Back to the deep with you!","Count them, I lost count.","Orcs, more orcs.","The halls are ours again."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"special","shout":"BAROOM!","lines":["Blasting powder!","For the halls!","The runes speak!","Stand back from the charge."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"frozen","shout":"COLD!","lines":["The deep cold bites.","Ice in the shafts.","My beard is frozen stiff."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"hungry","shout":"ALE!","lines":["Where is the ale?","Stone bread is still bread.","I could eat a cave troll."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"gold","shout":"MITHRIL!","lines":["Mithril!","Hoard +1.","Dwarf gold, home again.","Mine. All mine."]}
